# COVID-19 Testing Dataset (2021) - Sample Data

This Excel file includes all steps of the COVID-19 Testing Data Analysis performed in class:

## Tabs in the Workbook
- **Raw Data:** Original dataset provided in class
- **Data Cleaning:** Handling missing values, duplicates, and outliers
- **Data Preparation:** Transformations and categorical conversions
- **Pivot Table & Charts:** Exploratory visualizations
- **Scatter Plot:** Relationship analysis between temperature and test results
- **Dashboard:** Interactive Excel dashboard for dynamic data exploration

**Note:** This dataset is anonymized and for educational purposes only.

